0..74 Comment "//! Effect handlers and the exits through them, after Plotkin and Pretnar,"
75..153 Comment "//! _Handling Algebraic Effects_ [Plotkin-2013-handling_algebraic_effects]: an"
154..232 Comment "//! operation\'s clause may resume the handled body through its continuation or"
233..306 Comment "//! discard it, a body\'s `pure` value passes through the handler\'s `pure`"
307..383 Comment "//! clause, and a `return` leaves the handler with its value as it stands. A"
384..462 Comment "//! tail call is an exit too, so every `become` here is written: the exits are"
463..479 Comment "//! the subject."
480..483 Comment "//!"
484..513 Comment "//! - see: #1481 — `looped`"
514..549 Comment "//! - see: #1387 — `resume_stack`"
550..578 Comment "//! - see: #1651 — `Conts`"
579..633 Comment "//! - cites: [Plotkin-2013-handling_algebraic_effects]"
